      "arabic": "١١٣٦١- سوداء ،\nغير منسوبة.\nذكرها ابن سعد فيمن بايع النبيّ ﷺ.\nوأخرج عن عبد العزيز بن الخطاب، وإسماعيل بن أبان الورّاق، عن نائلة الكوفية، عن أم عاصم، عن السوداء، قالت: أتيت النبيّ ﷺ أبايعه، فقال: «اختضبي» . قالت: فاختضبت، ثم جئت فبايعته.",
      "english": "11361 — Sawda',\nwith no lineage given.\n\nIbn Sa'd listed her among those who pledged allegiance to the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace.\n\nHe transmitted from Abd al-Aziz ibn al-Khattab and Isma'il ibn Aban al-Warraq, from Na'ila al-Kufiyya, from Umm Asim, from al-Sawda', who said: “I came to the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, to pledge allegiance to him. He said, ‘Apply dye.’ She said: So I applied dye, then returned and pledged allegiance to him.”",
      "arabic_sha256": "e75c765f53296f9db918b503f693fd83ab8a7c6e8cc61247ba4ad6a1c66ffd25",
